    "title": "Prep Your Paws - Dog Themed Festival Coming to Ogden - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Angelika Brewer ,\n7 hours ago Ogden Downtown Alliance (ODA) is hosting the first annual “Dogden” festival during the Farmers Market on Sept. 13 from 8 a.m. to 1 p.m. The tail-wagging celebration in the Municipal Gardens on Ogden’s Historic 25th Street will feature a dog parade, giveaways, contests, dog agility course demonstrations, Dogden merchandise and more — all alongside artisans, fresh produce, and handmade goods. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
